# This repo is pi's live config dir (~/.pi). It mixes shareable setup docs with
# machine-local state and secrets, so ignore everything by default and allowlist
# only what should sync across machines. Add new shareable files with
# `git add -f` or by extending the allowlist below.
#
# Deliberately NOT synced (all covered by the `*` below):
#   agent/auth.json         credentials — must never leave this machine
#   agent/sessions/         conversation transcripts (private, large)
#   agent/npm/              installed extensions (node_modules; SETUP.md re-creates)
#   agent/APPEND_SYSTEM.md  generated by extension postinstalls
#   agent/bin/              downloaded binaries (fd, rg)
#   agent/models-store.json pi-managed model state
#   agent/settings.json     machine state (packages array); desired settings live in SETUP.md
#   agent/keybindings.json  documented in SETUP.md — keep one source of truth
#   agent/memory/           machine-local agent memory by design
#   cases/                  session reflection artifacts (may quote conversations)

*
!.gitignore
!SETUP.md
!agent/
!agent/skills/
!agent/skills/**
